  "cites": "a request labelled \"default\", the hardcoded label one open adapter ships, sent to a verifier configured with the single label \"2026-10\". The MAC was computed under the 2026-10 secret's derived key, so a verifier that falls back to the only secret it holds accepts it. The label is unknown, and an unknown key_id is SIGNATURE_INVALID with no fallback.",
